Paths not covered by this license

The following paths hold third-party material. The MIT License above does not
apply to them; each remains under the terms its owner publishes it under.

- patches/: changes to third-party Composer packages, each under its
  package's own license.
- resources/fonts/firago/: the FiraGO typeface, under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 (resources/fonts/firago/OFL.txt).
- resources/svg/: icon artwork.
- resources/raster_images/: photography and other raster images.
- resources/js/uams_2020/source/genesis/: a script from the Genesis framework
  by StudioPress.
- lang/vendor/statamic/: translations published from Statamic.
- app/Services/EnumGeneration/Schema/schemaorg-current-https.jsonld: the
  Schema.org vocabulary, under the terms Schema.org publishes it under.
